# What vsce leaves out of the .vsix: everything but the extension itself (package.json, extension.js,
# media/ with the runner's four scripts, the listing page, the changelog and the licence).
# The runtime is never packaged: the extension loads it from the website (D-081).
test/**
build.py
serve.py
make_icon.py
RESULTS.md
README.md
.gitignore
media/runner/runtime/**
media/runner/pyodide/**
*.vsix
